%U A401654 850151428269074922,38192584170798289026,1825600908439136048434,92515257197370750475758,4954598137403262582489594
%N A401654 a(0) = 1; a(n) = Sum_{k=1..n} binomial(2*n+k-1,k) * a(n-k).
%F A401654 G.f. A(x) satisfies A(x) = (1-3*x)/(1-x) * (2*A(x*(1-x)^2) - 1).
%F A401654 a(n) is even for n > 0.
%F A401654 a(n) ~ c * n! * n^(3*log(2)/4) * 2^n / log(2)^n, where c = 0.91040568485000918734203540695648862784850929787067343721653454209... - _Vaclav Kotesovec_, Nov 01 2026
%o A401654 (PARI) a_vector(n) = my(v=vector(n+1)); v[1]=1; for(i=1, n, v[i+1]=sum(j=1, i, binomial(2*i+j-1, j)*v[i-j+1])); v;
